{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36903","headline":"送光禄崔卿赴阙 · 罗隐","name":"送光禄崔卿赴阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一年极目望西辕，此日殷勤圣主恩。\n上国已留虞寄命，中朝应听范汪言。\n官从府幕归卿寺，路向干戈见禁门。\n鵷侣寂寥曹署冷，更堪呜咽问田园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}